        "TileImage": "$($repository 293579a3-b1d9-415a-ad3f-9f876892d9b1).Image",
        "Description": "Hello again 47.\r\rWe got a simple one for you, seems like theres been a disturbance in a sea-side house in New Zealand.\r\rWe&apos;re going to need you to eliminate all listed targets, they are a top priority and can be disposed off without further questions from the rest of the individuals at the location, if you do it quietly, I can handle destroying the evidence after.\r\rAlso try and practice your stabbing skills, I heard you we&apos;re are bit rusty from all the shoot-outs you&apos;ve been in.\r\rGood luck.",
